{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1568,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:721059d1e5adaa7dd60cab36",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "在日本国英国国旗的见证之下，\n在淀边赛场上赢得伊丽莎白女王杯的会是谁！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f2b0f8df9b511b17f311eb0357fb2e7cae8ea1bd79c5446ac52dafd4c649d2e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "41"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5574335a6c86400d1b00731b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "真是令人信服的强大，爱丽数码！\n在草地2000m战斗中也精彩地拿下了GⅠ的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2522a4ec3831870d593f7cf89a12b6ce4817f591d874123d4cce39bd2bd72d0f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a47f3bcdc3a03b4dc54c772c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "第一名是川上公主！\n无败的橡树大赛赛马娘此刻诞生！\n川上公主干得漂亮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "71dfdb0de7e84e9904115fac43100282495d3f93ad2ea27c25855004e1dce58a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:847ee2ae666a3436ccfc9291",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "从外道冲来的是曼城茶座！\n从外道冲来的是曼城茶座！\n其他马娘完全无法与之匹敌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7990f9da416b6dfdfdb83c2b94dba076054a666ce86260abc02de17c3a48c719",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2a99495fb135b2ecef7196e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "东瀛佐敦获胜！　我们见识到了她的毅力！\n首次拿下GⅠ头衔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5c7dfff9b99d073a335e40b3c78fd99b13c04f990e15e12a97ef1ef64bd9695",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd54122957339ab1ac3a8717",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "无论如何也要实现经典赛之梦！\n多伯，干得漂亮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "881325f72c5e66d25a87dfe5c94fa8151111b0d12ea66fc2ca80d446ad05a3fc",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ed4aaec2c55b33d0b4d45c9",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "美妙姿势！　无败的秋之女王诞生了！\n同世代中几乎已无人能敌！\n她有着无限的可能性！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1f603ea9bebaa416170cdb06b9dd3a4d518b6c44e39cd6562afffae8ddbf6fc",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52cbbf7f7f9c9a67b6c98073",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "玉藻十字！　是玉藻十字！\n古马的气魄！她击败了经典级的期待股\n达成天皇赏春秋连霸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c0b0444f43c520f61a7cd46da3f7f959d8572ff4aa711c7671430c296ae4708",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a22003263fdc863456a9e526",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "樱花千代王沿着外道冲了上来！\n樱花千代王冲到了领先位置！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78eca6f1cb4c9c4f758326705e64199e38bae953a69c3aee77f9c9ab586a009b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42ed2fccdd01fae13d2797b6",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "目白阿尔丹拼尽全力夺得领先！\n目白阿尔丹领先！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d467c1eff2b4c6968df9c62d1e80783645b0ac543e30c88b51eb4e91d26f98c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4108"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40713a54273651558d7fd696",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "制霸日本德比，\\n闪耀着一等星光辉的是爱慕织姬！\n果然赢得这场决战的是爱慕织姬！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2cd3bb036dcbc6f138212cd628f0ceabc3849eb19731a302edda9856b6711d7",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0316bef7a0b111945a6cb434",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "太久没有见过这种程度的比赛了！\n实在是惊人！\n从外道追上来的是待兼诗歌剧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "10764749c5803ce362cf472adbf19c9b92eda959b6d9030c377b3f4a28e92d71",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7a9a77889d997065e57f879",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "请听听这掌声！请听听这欢呼声！\n这是今年最后的北黑祭典！\n她堂堂正正地在有马纪念领放制胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "caf7cdda2dad28ba9f5cb614dd57909d6d772defdc5c6082fd9098e7bee670c4",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:811a05eeb58637b96bf4e2da",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "这一冠绝不退让，里见光钻！\n在这微阴的京都竞马场上\n钻石终于闪耀了光辉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb4a41a614e237015c206fa94d2ee6651e8ee2df8fafa8791921177ec9568caa",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4112"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50a1071005026f08ecdfce77",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "光明，是光明！\n她为目白家带来了春之盾！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37f9fe1b883a30f4e303c16484d53e293611a779ad26926c9638ebe1ac7d993c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fbd6543ee0bee318867c63c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "西野花！\\n用保持前列的战术在直线脱颖而出\\n成功制霸樱花赏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5b40ff530a5d213209c6af8e4f6d6cf63acfcb37f13c09e9e8c7101fa0fb1ab",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4114"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e97f7ccbc022e08695b8f401",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "成功制霸皋月赏，这府中的2000m赛场上，\\n八重无敌再次起舞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90b98914325b522a1474ba027fd7e28838ddceed4ec1b13805371499dc49eef8",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4115"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5c5c6ceb46f8e2676b0572d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "艾尼斯风神！　这场比赛绝不会输！\\n她为皋月赏一雪前耻\\n在这场日本德比成功取胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff1cfd86e7c9367a1f3c6e0fd0e02580d29bbc09a1c1a20d2bdbb5b31c68b400",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4116"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea2dc178e168cf7e4021927b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "是善信是善信！　善信一放到底！\\n目白善信全程领放\\n成功制霸大奖赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f704513ce4333a4891f1aff5fa52c7f0da1622329f5ced029e87e313a7d8d15",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4117"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52dab333c50904aa41d34630",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "稻荷一从内侧冲上来了！\\n稻荷一从内侧冲上来了！\\n稻荷一夺得了领先而且还在扩大差距！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e36b570b979726c5f5eafa153fd9cfcdae70b8b9ec67892bdf82d4a04931343",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4118"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cc9f76293507d26a1875276",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "第1名东商变革！　成功赶超制胜！\\n这位赛马娘的实力货真价实！　今天的胜利由她收入囊中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76e703aaa964e64f52a804c0e35d71124ed6cc1b9a2571555374599735307bcf",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4119"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5a52791945750171eea08f2",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "三冠之路要从皋月赏开始！\\n干得漂亮！　空中神宫夺冠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "508e3c1d133497c26ae909d1b906bddc193310832482ed58391965835a75c8f0",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4120"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d77cb4c3bd37b5193dd8c5b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "宝冢纪念，你我的梦想都将在此奔跑。\n我的梦想，就是青竹回忆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b45876b6c1e4064842b99a67d762a33ee821768fe2108064595d4ca32344bae",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:955ebb45f067b7041399e300",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "春之霸者在秋季依旧实力强劲！\\n小林历奇，称霸JBC经典赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d954cf1a0c5477f0b1a33513a5ff824271738e036fec52860b0dfe27b10124df",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4122"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe0f3550702a6c081ddb86d0",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "雪之美人！\\n这就是顽强的陆奥精神！这就是不屈的陆奥精神！\\n雪之美人的实力之强已毫无争议！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24d80dd946df43f709ebe9ebe5b71115b1ab45778429ed78b3f9d50ed4940589",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4123"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c0c2492b0bd14aa420918f9",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "是采珠的胜利！\\n这是毋庸置疑的名马娘之道！　毋庸置疑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37a7779a95d57115441c1bb133d5fd8d81a2ca4dc5cc88141630996c3fad3af7",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4124"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3447a4781f1cef391e456e4",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "获胜的是真弓快车！\\n出色的领放！\\n漂亮地赢下了短途马锦标！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2275950588f64b921e259386b3cecee898ec72e86dfb2b4f8e0027472bfd7c3",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4125"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46ed4bd0eed26ec91eec142c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "也文摄辉安田纪念连霸！\\n她最终的冲刺极为强悍\\n也文摄辉获胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d604a6204b9f7d8f3ccd378284ec4a9ab500a2e786f5bc974bee23f68f911319",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4126"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd7c955e9bd50712d64406c3",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "中山庆典，惊人的表现！\\n是未曾亮出过底牌的中山庆典！\\n制霸宝冢纪念！　场内一片哗然！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73ca67739f52297810880c6b6100fb56a08d8faa7f772a40c580d2a6ba93e2d1",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4127"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f55e5d2179ebea22aeb206b0",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "外道的是奇锐骏！\\n奇锐骏！\\n奇锐骏冲出来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9315d98ae8b6fd84fd522d09671739fa31c8863e2c26327b0fec024e025da0a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4128"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59d3a8903e917525f9cb5f17",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "获胜的是荒漠英雄！\\n接二连三的GⅠ挑战后她第一次获得了荣誉！\\n获得了天皇赏秋之盾！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f23fea8f82d3fc96ef14929c97e846f0139216cff259d640a937ddc598ee7126",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4129"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d95fd3250f20a17406e45831",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "今年这条赛道上最闪耀的是北港火山！\\n称霸了年终最重大的东京大赏典！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89c55625180fa3d1558db512b603c66db2db8426e3651b66831a5cbdc5ab9bcc",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4130"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91eeefb5c17cd67e5d98e077",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "大拓紧接着去年取得连胜！\\n大拓紧接着去年取得连胜！\\n大拓太阳神举起右手，那是她的胜利姿势！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27b312c4f2a8191afca4e7823a8628fbeaa85b8815aaf925045e4836b98a39c4",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1d9d9598e4f261bb689f699",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "府中的沙土之王，新光风！\\n她的模样足以称得上王者的雄姿，\\n此时正在东京竞马场高唱凯歌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6154587f28fb7aee356bc45f6e5c9338de6dc81cdf64e72d90d305a4f759c88d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4132"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bd9db5b713e6cbead0a0716",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "千明代表现在领先！\\n是连大地都为之震撼的千明代表！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40332c078bfaae27eeba9ce1786fde199d2b5ec9bbd4014a70fb5d587481e090",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4133"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:884d5f11c4e8ad68e5c989e8",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "双涡轮咆哮！\\n她以全开的涡轮发动机成功逃脱！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6cac87e775f4ae421e32e3ec96daa38b63a520dd9bb858a292ea41994eeb237",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4134"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed989c66f22383120a36da1c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "获胜的是第一红宝石！\\n华丽一族的继承者第一红宝石！\\n首次制霸了GⅠ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7642c149f9e29f7df2bf65b47636277d90c45275d5b7289dd2b6b7e9afb3449a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4135"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa650ed6c05de4aa3c64cec6",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "获胜的是吉兆！\\n打破常识的古马级挑战中，赢得了GⅠ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "805c1cee7095bd2cc51597f516a523300573780c742f7c8768f4870c9d58438b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4136"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4332b63456e73280971ea2dd",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "突围的是樱花桂冠！\\n她在大奖赛史上第一次刻上了\\n樱花之名！　是樱花桂冠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aebacc68940eb4dcf6b51d9c2a97876366eccc93bdb8559d64c6490e96002368",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4137"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a6c0978a06a8409ca6d1cc7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "完美取得皋月赏・德比两冠！\\n她在多云天气下的东京竞马场完成了这项壮举！\\n是新宇宙！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3b7809ad21b007422a344b40c9d75bb9a97aad2780a6c72ed5df6bd7fa2bf3f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4138"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01616c64c61d742201e55134",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "再一次出现了奇迹～，阪神竞马场！\\n能拿下天皇赏菊花赏绝非徒有虚名！\\n获胜的是天皇赏、菊花赏赛马娘菱钻奇宝！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27343686e6e3c17f523a3ba0145a12db7d7894a5542bee82828c178dbc4b4f04",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4139"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a89d36a97352eba2ccb1d89e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "谷野美酒果然强大！\\n这次是、这次是、这次终于是炸裂的末脚～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52cbf28ce372bf0a24c22ca7caa8c2217cebc50edb1a68e78237471b09b07570",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4140"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b19bc573c5d930c3c1076a6",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "从容不迫地赢下了大阪杯！！\\n毫不懈怠地迎接春季比赛！美丽周日获得压倒性胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be6c6176dced0e1da3d26f4d5216852b0700bccbdaaf817e4b2e532918478cb7",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4141"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9e199b4e8b52746aefb3eeb",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "葛城王牌堂堂领放到底！\\n葛城王牌用惊人的领放到底\\n赢得了日本杯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "55619cc5ccfffca69c7d7add402480bae7ee9c4642d835e724f8a5e32f67b0b6",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4142"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e0aa6f1cc4ff2a2251a7754",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "漂亮地克服了重重压力\\n成为耀眼的德比赛马娘！\\n制霸战国的少年武士便是天狼星象征！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd5a17def9564b72e61991edbae2bf5026e7b7327ff01b4452da79882f85cc6b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4143"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d1b173326c1bb409758ed0f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "做到了做到了！　成田路她做到了！\\n可喜可贺，可喜可贺地制霸了菊花赏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "10092481b916065fd0a7749e689dea62939189ffd5c71aaa9a0f9d121fc6b4ca",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4144"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61966b9b18432b8e580dbee5",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "凯斯奇迹，创造了奇迹！\\n她刚刚堂堂正正地赢得了短途马锦标，\\n证明了自己是“时代最速”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9f0a94f21311386905f2bf5c43a175d230eb79ffb8e2cbfa63c28641e3c4e2d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4145"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd8bfeeb20af7608dcdc3b1a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "获胜的是目白高峰！\\n堂堂正正的胜利，真是堂堂正正的胜利！　毋庸置疑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "13cd6d08d567df780881af878f4e9f633f7949c1a534362df254d16b2c4cc619",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4146"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae21d74d016d58db2a874dea",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "2400m的领放正是如此！\\n在内侧道惊艳众人！\\n跳舞城！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20e3f1b1f2457c6ea6a62fb93c14209cfcffb33594aba1db07b0121e19595b94",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4147"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f72ad00cd7b8c637edc41b89",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "竟然、竟然是里见皇冠！\\n战胜强敌制霸宝冢纪念！",
      "source_fingerprint": "da1d809e016d5475a4d35e84e688a86aea2e12b3ce421c2822c9b721527b9215",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4148"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d9a0ad83bd85029ae723b80",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "她做到了！　高尚骏逸！\\n在这府中赢下了一场\\n不输姐姐和妹妹的大战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2945e1fb918e3f38d541d853cc7cebaf01f6933b612912a1aee3360f85b59124",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4149"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c99cc72477e91c89848672f3",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "外道冲出来的竟然是大鸣大放！\\n竟如此强大吗～！\\n大鸣大放！",
      "source_fingerprint": "402be2b7d6ae301d29a73b4e55473d79c1259285c51b480e720be8f63931c9d1",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4150"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:364bacb6e4f92a2b68a50b9a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "是强击！　达成姐姐未能实现的梦想，\\n现在由妹妹强击夺得了最后一冠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7c1cbd1fc0ebba05ee7f45419277f48786ad84e957c3ef3a316dedd01c7ac1c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4151"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c96bb5eca270cc334663eb5",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "微光飞驹！是微光飞驹！\\n赢得了秋季的初战，为我们带来一场出乎意料的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7cee1bb1d91ec1ba6da068a8e495fa633406eaf2ff93ca523b947fd51ea9623",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4152"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06d1b5e4fdb1d002ee439e68",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "作为第3位从前面两人当中冲出来了！\\n冲出来的是生野狄杜斯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "50f0ceb900b1e5a7a599020b3c656b05e079dc2d6d666f5c386d64487a3389c9",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4153"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7b520d406bf8844f6651c4a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "毋庸置疑！　创升达成连霸！\\n获得冠军杯连霸走向世界舞台！",
      "source_fingerprint": "969a3cfc23ef1de5ff3c8eb894483bd34f0b7e333edab030b821cb62419fbd3d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4154"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73e1cb07c880c83b1b43cfc8",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "莱茵力量二冠达成！　新的女杰诞生了！\\n莱茵力量英里赛极强，\\n真是一场精彩的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0443c6e768ee1e218df083af15a3c647e2cb16ff3972f7b2c2d93cce49f57bb0",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4155"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cdc401e184b5e8e1a4f1d8b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "不甘于做名配角的万籁争鸣！\\n制霸这场梦之大奖赛的女主角\\n是万籁争鸣！",
      "source_fingerprint": "408c74733be82beda7bbf6659b2b7534bd497bb94d9086b8165a1d3edffd0267",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4156"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8dc37b0deda0ec4d0975381",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "获胜的是北方飞翔！\\n不断获胜的北方飞翔\\n赢得了本场安田纪念！",
      "source_fingerprint": "743146b369f65df05e231598bc006ae31dfa6ab47c97fab9bab2f5dabd09e008",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4157"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff238a858763d37efc648080",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "获胜的是森林宝穴！\\n获胜的是森林宝穴！\\n开启了新时代之门的就是森林宝穴！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01bba6d110ae7e8fcdf0f54467392a7538ea32db1f971800c0926565574d65e0",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4158"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b4718301fbbe67f09a518f6",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "是梦之旅！　是梦之旅！　这就是通向梦想的旅途！\\n梦之旅领先了！\\n梦之旅获得第1！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe380f636b5b69d85e1810e4532bd616f7278015ddf40cfefd4b6d907bbc2e4b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4159"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5956ba951b9b09973e4c606",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "金镇之光领放！\\n第2名多旺达要被甩开了！\\n金镇之光ーー！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "020daf36ff41dd341849f59bfd831b16358686c1bc8c8bf4438f7834addeb70f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4160"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba606ce2ad6bafd4de0c6229",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "贵妇人！　极峰！\\n贵妇人来到外道！\\n极峰！　二人几乎同时冲线！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16aa0093957f6b5de98d601a1cf489fdab93992cba16dbf88907b37b85dc4ded",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4161"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:454235e9111eb4521c48531f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "“你好”和“再见”被她同时演绎！\\n在暮色中的中山梦之大奖赛，迎来盛大的告别！\\n这位如画般美丽的少女，贵妇人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b696379dd7a6edf84d70d20891d2065085ce2c760ca42c3104b473471c81053c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4162"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02fccb6ce618d122f974131b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "青发飘扬的西沙里奥！\\n西沙里奥在后冠光辉的引导下\\n精彩地赢下日本橡树大赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cadf2dbbfe5ecc11bce6260f4cdf60c8286203b1e206cd67eaf62d7afb067f94",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4163"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32e7a248d20ed1fcd0b94794",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "名刀的锋利今年也未减分毫，\\n多旺达获得二连霸！\\n今年依旧锋利光亮，多旺达！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc181adbc4739ddd5dcb717eb815e98220a58b9945a6963cd51bbcae6726957b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4164"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d168223b8ec19291c7f5f8ff",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "内侧的吹波糖！　内侧的吹波糖！\\n是吹波糖！　是吹波糖！　吹波糖获胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92478fa9149f38fbecd246d7f58fd1484bba2b1f418118a17764aabec9d9271b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4165"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6144ad4112fe7f59c1055c39",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "母亲未能触及的后冠光辉！\\n女儿空中救世主，如今亲手将其摘下，\\n出色地弥补了当年的遗憾！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eda5619eb73d49f2505e22be02a0f481df8f823b40067a70878e648790539618",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4166"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82b5954cfe059f653f10ae3a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "在这场大赛舞台上最闪耀的是凯旋芭蕾！\\n凭借自己的双脚出色地夺得主角之位，\\n拿下了秋季大奖赛赛马娘的称号！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15c2b9569ae7805679d64028752f3f35925b1699489476ed269d1acce84872b1",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4167"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17d5ec724aed4434ba26dba4",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "在擅长的舞台上压制了中央军，狂怒乐章！\\n制霸帝王赏，再次拿下了\\n一个GⅠ头衔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b50723a148ebc035b3c5048725f1b5394779d340dce32df6fae0296df38a661",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4168"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35f1ff0a72d0f834411454ae",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "鹤丸刚志果然很强！\\n虽然特别周和草上飞也很强，\\n但今年有马纪念的主角是鹤丸刚志！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bd3e5738e3d544431c3e0250a0b04e0dd2d5f57ead58ea2ec4fedfcf1365f4a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4169"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f4370edfd11677b7909b2ac",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "何等强大的实力！完全不在话下！\\n这就是比赛！黄金巨匠完胜！\\n出色地为最后的有马纪念画上了句号！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8558b1e487d77cececaa4e11b26c62fe0bfffd64656d78dcbc1293d13831d11",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4170"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77f4b0961284e86994280f31",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "从大外道一气呵成冲上来的是放声欢呼！\\n末脚完全不同！简直是不同次元的跑法！\\n放声欢呼以压倒性优势冲线！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f98996b18311d6dcebe7438e8f5d85c51cdf619790aad049924bc4c7f44c9e8d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4171"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:290cb9a956aa0c1b752a7e92",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "请不要说是莫名其妙的反抗！\\n莫名其妙击退了谷野琴蕾，制霸皋月赏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1a7108ca1a5cf1f5d3055f24e9d5a4ceddcce622832c13445e2ed05b3eb1190",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4172"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5ba7aaeb39ba6a8ec1e80a9",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "黄金船竟然马失前蹄！\\n比赛中没有绝对！\\n制霸今年天皇赏（春）的是超常骏骥！",
      "source_fingerprint": "709ee496dbba52719a408c6fd2d77fecc9374c183ffac5f5f29b2bc9c4551840",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4173"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:febbdc8ef9e28e0364ade388",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "在第五次挑战中终于夙愿得偿的极峰！\\n瞳孔中重拾光芒，在维多利亚英里赛中\\n赢下了首个GⅠ冠军！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4d602df3028acda49a2d007a333a7a9a8cd943cf949f3892a89ece75d3b1734",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4174"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5bd51702a74a605a64a0011",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "无败的橡树赛马娘诞生！\\n以4战4胜制霸三冠第二关·橡树大赛的，\\n正是唯独爱你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dbc6002e961cff6607e9d76d18dc150aacd5b4fec48ae7a4da9dd00c4ad8ec4",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4175"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4899a0dd549bfaf7878e4bdc",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "真是一强独秀，以独走之势制霸了春季大奖赛！\\n通往现役最强之路将由这位赛马娘开启，\\n创世驹！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d90c3d0ba06a513eb8a00dbb79767aa3a27d0a5c1a6979c5a8e6b14a01592f24",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4176"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:503a90787fcd32d2bd0672d9",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "击败了去年的女王东商变革，以及\\n同期的劲敌川上公主，\\n戴上后冠的是房一潘多拉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "38ee8f3b05465c7ba8d3f829587862c05a833bfac553f817a34c6ae1b2c91e27",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4177"
      ]
    },
    {
